---
{
  title: "cfile_exists"
}
---
### NAME

    cfile_exists() - Checks if a LPC source file exists.

### SYNOPSIS

    int cfile_exists( string file );

### DESCRIPTION

    Checks if a LPC source file exists.

    Resolves the source file via source_file(), which prefers a sibling .lpc
    and falls back to .c.

### PARAMETERS

    file  (string)
          Base path of LPC file, with or without extension

### RETURN VALUES

    (int) 1 if source file exists, 0 otherwise

### EXAMPLE

    {{di1}}if(cfile_exists("/cmds/dev/update")) {
        compile_object("/cmds/dev/update");
    }{{di0}}
